[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0010","text":"辛苦了\n教练一直在夸路加呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0020","text":"啊……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0030","text":"说在合宿期间进步很大\n不管是身体能力，还是表现力……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0040","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0050","text":"你真的很努力了\n谢谢你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0060","text":"喂────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0070","text":"嗯？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0080","text":"……你也觉得我变好了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0090","text":"诶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0100","text":"我问的是，看起来是不是变好了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0110","text":"……当然"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0120","text":"虽然不像教练那样的专业人士，\n但用我的眼睛看，也能看出变化"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0130","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0140","text":"来合宿真是太好了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0150","text":"哈？那是练习量的问题吧\n不是合宿也一样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0160","text":"哈哈，确实\n也许是这样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0170","text":"但成果是实实在在的……\n太好了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0180","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_03_0181","text":"Motion"}]
